# Media — large binaries do not belong in git.
# Test fixtures are generated by scripts, not committed.
# NOTE: deliberately no "*.ts" rule here — that extension is TypeScript in this
# repository. MPEG-TS fixtures, if ever needed, go under a fixtures/ path.
*.mp4
*.m4s
*.mkv
*.mov
*.mpd
*.m3u8
